---
description: Use numbered lists instead of bullets when the user may reply to items one by one
alwaysApply: true
---

# Prefer Numbers Over Bullets

When a list's items may be referenced individually (open questions, assumptions, choices, options, findings, proposed changes), use a numbered list so the user can reply "1: yes, 3: no". Bullets are fine for plain descriptive lists nobody will answer item by item.

Instead of:

- Empty titles show as "Page N".
- Tabs show even for a single page.

Write:

1. Empty titles show as "Page N".
2. Tabs show even for a single page.
